## 12. 📱 Screen Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Splash] --> B{Has Token?}
    B -->|No + First time| C[Onboarding]
    B -->|No| D[Login]
    B -->|Yes| E[Home/Feed]
    C --> D
    D --> F[Register]
    D --> G[Forgot Password]
    D -->|Success| E

    E --> H[Story Bar → Story Viewer]
    E --> I[Post Card → Post Detail]
    E --> J[🔔 Notifications]
    I --> K[Comments]
    I --> L[Author Profile]

    M[Search Tab] --> L
    L --> N[Followers/Following]
    L --> O[Message → Chat Room]

    P[Create Tab] --> Q[Create Post]
    P --> R[Create Story]

    S[Chat Tab] --> T[Chat List → Chat Room]

    U[Profile Tab] --> V[Edit Profile]
    U --> W[Settings]
    W --> X[Logout → Login]
```
